====================================================================
DOMAIN: The Theses, Jetztzeit, and Messianic Time
SEARCH_DATE: 2026-06-10
PAPERS_FOUND: 17 total (High: 8, Medium: 6, Low: 2, INCOMPLETE: 5)
SEARCH_SOURCES: SEP, PhilPapers, Semantic Scholar, OpenAlex, CrossRef
